# HerePremium Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** October 22, 2026  
**Last Updated:** October 22, 2026

## 1. Introduction

Welcome to HerePremium (“we,” “our,” or “the App”). HerePremium is a camera application designed to recreate the experience of film photography by allowing users to capture photos during a session and view them only after the session's development period has ended.

Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how HerePremium handles photos, session information, device permissions, and other information when you use the App.

## 2. Information We Handle

### Photos and Camera Content

HerePremium uses your device's camera to capture photographs when you choose to take pictures.

Photos captured during a session are stored locally on your device. They remain unavailable for viewing within the App until the session's development period has ended.

For example, if you start a 30-minute session, your photos become available for viewing after the 30-minute development period is complete.

We use these photos solely to provide the App's photography, delayed-development, viewing, and download features.

### Session Information

The App may store information required to manage your photography sessions, such as session start times, development durations, completion status, and references to photos associated with each session.

This information is used to enforce the development period and make photos available when the session is complete.

### Downloaded Photos

After a session has finished developing, you can view your photos and download them for printing or personal use.

When you download or export a photo, the resulting file may be saved to a location you choose on your device. Once exported, the photo may be accessible through your device's file manager, photo library, or other applications, depending on where you save it.

Please remember that photos you export may no longer be protected by the App's delayed-viewing feature.

## 3. How We Use Information

Information handled by HerePremium is used to:

- Operate the camera and capture photos.
- Store photos and associate them with the correct session.
- Enforce the session's development timer.
- Make photos available when development is complete.
- Allow you to view and download developed photos.
- Maintain the App's core functionality and preferences.

We do not use your photos for advertising, facial recognition, artificial intelligence training, or unrelated purposes unless this policy is updated and any required permissions or consents are obtained.

## 4. Local Storage and Cloud Services

HerePremium is designed around local photo storage. Photos and session information are stored on your device rather than being uploaded to a photo-hosting service, provided the current version of the App operates as described.

We do not receive or view your locally stored photos through normal App use if they remain entirely on your device.

Your device manufacturer or operating system may separately back up app data according to your device settings. If you export or share photos through another application or service, that service may handle the photos under its own privacy policy.

**Important:** This section must be updated if HerePremium uses a server, cloud storage, online accounts, remote analytics, or another service that receives personal information or photo content.

## 5. Camera and Photo Permissions

HerePremium requires camera access to capture photographs.

The App may also request permission to save photos or access a selected storage location when you choose to download or export developed photos.

These permissions are used to provide the features you request. You can manage app permissions through your device's settings. If you deny a required permission, some features may not work.

## 6. Sharing and Disclosure

We do not sell your personal information or your photos.

If photos are stored entirely on your device and no online service receives them, we do not share those photos with the developer or third parties during normal App use.

You may choose to export, print, or share developed photos through other applications or services. Any sharing you initiate is subject to the privacy practices of the service or recipient you choose.

We may disclose information if required by applicable law or where necessary to protect legal rights and comply with lawful requests.

## 7. Data Retention and Deletion

Photos and session information may remain on your device until you delete them, clear the relevant App data, or uninstall the App, subject to your device's storage and backup settings.

If the App provides a delete-session or delete-photo feature, you can use it to remove the corresponding content.

Before uninstalling the App or clearing its data, consider exporting any photos you want to keep. Locally stored photos may be permanently lost when App data is removed.

We cannot delete copies you have exported to other locations or services on your behalf.

## 8. Security

We take reasonable steps through the App's design and operation to protect locally stored photos and session information.

However, no device or storage method can be guaranteed completely secure. Protect your device with an appropriate screen lock, keep your operating system updated, and be careful when exporting or sharing photographs.

The delayed-viewing feature controls when photos are available inside HerePremium. It should not be understood as a guarantee that every photo is inaccessible through all possible device-level methods unless the App's implementation specifically ensures this.

## 9. Children's Privacy

HerePremium is not intended to collect personal information from children through the developer's servers. If the App is used by children, parents or guardians should supervise device use and photo sharing.

If future versions introduce accounts, online storage, analytics, or other data collection, additional children's privacy protections may be necessary.

